  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/majd/ipatool/zipball/v2.7.0",
  "body": "This release adds MCP integration and improves authentication, download reliability, and app version discovery.\r\n\r\n- MCP support: exposes tools for AI agents (search, download, list-purchases, list-versions, get-version-metadata, and purchase).\r\n- Phone-number sign-in: adds supported for phone-number login in mainland China and India.\r\n- tvOS downloads: allows delisted tvOS apps to be downloaded by numeric app ID.\r\n- watchOS: supports downloading standalone watchOS apps.\r\n- Apple Arcade: supports lookups for Apple Arcade apps.\r\n- Legacy macOS apps: supports retrieving old installer packages for macOS.\r\n- macOS: improves support for macOS 27.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/majd/ipatool/compare/v2.6.0...v2.7.0",
